# secrets / local migrate (never push)
migrate-bundle/
setup.md
*.local.md
.env
.env.*

# junk / heavy
**/cdn-cache/
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
**/*.db
**/cookie.txt
**/.DS_Store
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/*.webp
